      "title": "A rival calling Destiny's death 'existentially threatening'",
      "caption": "Warframe's director says Destiny 2 dying is 'horrible' and 'existentially threatening' — for Warframe. Odd, until you get it: live-service games share an audience's *time budget*, not just a genre. When a big one dies, players don't migrate, they leave. The tide going out lowers every boat.",
      "format": "quote",
      "bestPlatform": "bluesky",
      "triggers": [
        "novelty",
        "social-currency"
      ]
    },
