      "topic": "gaming",
      "title": "Console makers should be afraid of 'the thousands'",
      "caption": "Industry vets: console makers must innovate or die, and should fear 'the thousands' — the flood of small studios shipping on open platforms. The console's moat was distribution. Once Steam and itch are the default, a walled garden is just a garden with worse plants.",
