      "topic": "gaming",
      "title": "Read the layoff math: it's a management cull",
      "caption": "Xbox layoffs, broken down: no studios closed, 4 moved under new management, 3,200 jobs gone, management-layer reduction. The tell isn't the number, it's the shape — they're not cutting games, they're cutting the org chart. This is a company reorganising to make fewer, not to make better.",
      "format": "splitProof",
      "bestPlatform": "bluesky",
