      "title": "Sony's already repurposing its disc factory",
      "caption": "Buried in the gaming news: Sony's PlayStation disc factory is already being repurposed. Not 'planning to phase out discs' — already reallocating the plant. The clearest signal of where a company's going isn't its roadmap, it's what it's quietly dismantling.",
