      "title": "The Shadow of the Colossus creator's back, on Xbox",
      "caption": "gen ATLAS: a new game from Fumito Ueda (Shadow of the Colossus, ICO) — and it's an Xbox debut. The story isn't the game, it's the exclusivity flip: the auteurs who defined PlayStation's identity are now shipping elsewhere first. Platform loyalty was always a contract, not a value.",
